{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01V8sZTEiKdSsgZFozm4ZxM7","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Roadmap — Panel-Ops\n2\t**Owner:** Architect AI. This file is the authoritative execution plan.\n3\t**Read-only for executors and the dashboard.** Runtime status lives in `roadmap-status.md`.\n4\tBaseline statuses here are descriptive only.\n5\t\n6\tExecutor rules (binding for every ticket): read `comments/<TICKET>.jsonl` first, human\n7\tcomments are binding; implement only the assigned ticket; respect invariants; run\n8\tverification; update `roadmap-status.md`; append completion/blockage comment; never edit\n9\t`roadmap.md`; never touch files outside \"Files allowed to change\".\n10\t\n11\tGlobal invariants (apply to every APP/INF/INT ticket): server-side role enforcement;\n12\tsoft deletes only; append-only Activity; all writes via LockService path; no credentials\n13\tin code; Spanish UI text, English identifiers; schemas exactly per `data-model.md`.\n14\t\n15\tPhases: 0 Discovery · 1 Governance + Operational Control · 2 Parts + Quotation ·\n16\t3 Approval + Payment · 4 Optimizer Exports · 5 AI (not yet ticketed).\n17\t\n18\t---\n19\t\n20\t## Phase 0 — Discovery (human tasks, tracked as tickets)\n21\t\n22\t## DIS-001 — Optimizer Format Samples\n23\t\n24\t- Status baseline: pending\n25\t- Recommended model: human (Management/Advisor) — not an agent task\n26\t- Dependencies: none\n27\t- Objective: Obtain real import files accepted by LEPTON and KDT Optimizer plus full format specs.\n28\t- Context: `integration-contracts.md §1–2`. INT-001/INT-002 are hard-blocked on this.\n29\t- Scope: real LEPTON file; real KDT file; exact columns and order; units; decimal separator; delimiter; encoding; grain/rotation rules; material/thickness encoding; edge-band encoding; required vs optional columns.\n30\t- Out of scope: building adapters.\n31\t- Architectural invariants: executors must never invent these formats.\n32\t- Files allowed to change: `discovery/optimizers/` (new samples + notes)\n33\t- Deliverables: sample files + `discovery/optimizers/format-notes.md`\n34\t- Verification commands: n/a (human)\n35\t- Acceptance criteria: both files verified accepted by the real software; every format question in `integration-contracts.md` answered in writing.\n36\t- Rollback notes: n/a\n37\t- Architect notes: photograph/screenshot software import screens if docs unavailable.\n38\t\n39\t## DIS-002 — Existing Web Quotation Tool Discovery\n40\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3149de6f-ce51-47f6-ab52-20d79d233131","uuid":"968b0235-e027-47e6-aa43-ca4c06b7da02","timestamp":"2026-07-18T14:08:21.300Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/work945/Documents/Proyectos/ABM/proyectos/panel-ops/roadmap.md","content":"# Roadmap — Panel-Ops\n**Owner:** Architect AI. This file is the authoritative execution plan.\n**Read-only for executors and the dashboard.** Runtime status lives in `roadmap-status.md`.\nBaseline statuses here are descriptive only.\n\nExecutor rules (binding for every ticket): read `comments/<TICKET>.jsonl` first, human\ncomments are binding; implement only the assigned ticket; respect invariants; run\nverification; update `roadmap-status.md`; append completion/blockage comment; never edit\n`roadmap.md`; never touch files outside \"Files allowed to change\".\n\nGlobal invariants (apply to every APP/INF/INT ticket): server-side role enforcement;\nsoft deletes only; append-only Activity; all writes via LockService path; no credentials\nin code; Spanish UI text, English identifiers; schemas exactly per `data-model.md`.\n\nPhases: 0 Discovery · 1 Governance + Operational Control · 2 Parts + Quotation ·\n3 Approval + Payment · 4 Optimizer Exports · 5 AI (not yet ticketed).\n\n---\n\n## Phase 0 — Discovery (human tasks, tracked as tickets)\n\n## DIS-001 — Optimizer Format Samples\n\n- Status baseline: pending\n- Recommended model: human (Management/Advisor) — not an agent task\n- Dependencies: none\n- Objective: Obtain real import files accepted by LEPTON and KDT Optimizer plus full format specs.\n- Context: `integration-contracts.md §1–2`. INT-001/INT-002 are hard-blocked on this.\n- Scope: real LEPTON file; real KDT file; exact columns and order; units; decimal separator; delimiter; encoding; grain/rotation rules; material/thickness encoding; edge-band encoding; required vs optional columns.\n- Out of scope: building adapters.\n- Architectural invariants: executors must never invent these formats.\n- Files allowed to change: `discovery/optimizers/` (new samples + notes)\n- Deliverables: sample files + `discovery/optimizers/format-notes.md`\n- Verification commands: n/a (human)\n- Acceptance criteria: both files verified accepted by the real software; every format question in `integration-contracts.md` answered in writing.\n- Rollback notes: n/a\n- Architect notes: photograph/screenshot software import screens if docs unavailable.\n\n## DIS-002 — Existing Web Quotation Tool Discovery\n","numLines":40,"startLine":1,"totalLines":525}}}
